/// - `queue_outbox_inter.dart`: how an item enters the queue.
/// - `queue_handler.dart`: how an item leaves it (one handler per
///   operation, registered by each feature).
/// - `queue_priority.dart`: which items are sent first.
/// - `queue_sync_status.dart`: where an item stands.
/// - `queue_sync_columns.dart`: how a feature joins its records with
///   their queue item to read that status.
